{'symbol': 'C', 'date': '2019-11-11 22:30:00', 'title': 'TRUMID FINANCIAL LLC ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS RECEIVED FUNDING FROM CITIGROUP INC.', 'text': 'TRUMID FINANCIAL LLC ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS RECEIVED FUNDS IN A ROUND OF FUNDING ON NOVEMBER 12, 2019. THE TRANSACTION INCLUDED PARTICIPATION FROM NEW INVESTOR, CITIGROUP INC. (NYSE:C). THE INVESTOR INVESTED THROUGH SPREAD PRODUCTS INVESTMENT TECHNOLOGIES PROGRAM.'}{'symbol': 'C', 'date': '2019-11-10 22:30:00', 'title': 'CITI ANNOUNCES PARTNERSHIP WITH ROBERTS & RYAN INVESTMENTS', 'text': 'CITI ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A MENTOR-PROTÉGÉ PARTNERSHIP WITH ROBERTS & RYAN INVESTMENTS INC., A SERVICE-DISABLED VETERAN-OWNED (SDVO) INSTITUTIONAL BROKER DEALER. THROUGH THIS PARTNERSHIP, CITI WILL PROVIDE MENTORSHIP TO ROBERTS & RYAN ACROSS SEVERAL PRODUCT AND SERVICE AREAS, AND OFFER TRAINING TO ENHANCE THEIR FIRM’S OPERATIONS AND COMPLIANCE, AS WELL AS CONSULTATION ON BUSINESS AND ORGANIZATIONAL MANAGEMENT.'}